{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/banner_en.png?t=1749489560\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Dive into interstellar war</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Galactic Outlaws, you\u2019re part of an elite squadron tasked with impossible missions: sabotage, high-stakes rescues, and battles against enemy fleets. Choose your ship, customize its loadout, and face dynamic challenges across diverse scenarios\u2014from enemy-infested asteroids to burning space stations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/banner001_en.png?t=1749489560\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock and upgrade a fleet of ships, each with distinct weapons and attributes (speed, shields, firepower). Mix modules to suit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/Secuencia_01.gif?t=1749489560\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/banner002_en.png?t=1749489560\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Precision lasers, homing missiles, plasma cannons\u2014experiment to find your perfect combo!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/Secuencia_02.gif?t=1749489560\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/banner003_en.png?t=1749489560\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight across war-torn planets, asteroid belts, and enemy capital ships, each with unique challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/Secuencia_03.gif?t=1749489560\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/banner004_en.png?t=1749489560\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your hangar, unlock special abilities, and dominate the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/Secuencia_04.gif?t=1749489560\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/banner005_en.png?t=1749489560\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face rival factions with adaptive AI and epic bosses that will test your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/extras/Secuencia_05.gif?t=1749489560\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Do you have what it takes to survive this galactic war?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3661630?t=1749489560","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3661630?t=1749489560","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3661630/61be3a62ebc90